red soul.\n\nYou understand my music. You understand everything I am.\n\nAt the very start of this journey, we were forced apart.\nBut now, I know\u2014\nSomewhere in this world, you have always been listening to my music, listening to my performances.\nYou have always been trying to reach me with your voice.\n\nNo matter when, no matter what we face, or why we were torn apart...\nWe will be reunited.\n\nThat is the one truth I hold onto.", "summary": "Welcome to the world of the artcore narrative rhythm game Morpho Reverie. You are my kindred soul. No matter what, you never miss my performance. This time, play music with me. And when we do\u2014we will surely be reunited.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/morpho-reverie", "videos": [{"id": 194504, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "2r00VQMmUAU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2r00VQMmUAU", "title": "Rhythm Adventure Game \"Morpho Reverie\" 1st Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2r00VQMmUAU/fhddefault.jpg"}]}